{"ID":"20240205153717-qda6vpb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153717-qda6vpb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153717-qda6vpb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171746-hlnjgqk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611153505-etrqdw6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"178茅根（白茅根）","type":"doc","updated":"20240814195843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205171746-hlnjgqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171746-hlnjgqk","updated":"20240205171816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【產地】\t主產河南、遼寧、河北、山西、山東、陝西、新疆等北方地區。\n【性狀】\t根莖長圓柱形，有時分枝，長短不一，長3060cm，直徑24mm。表面黃白色或淡黃色，有光澤，具縱皺紋，環節明顯，節上殘留灰棕色鱗葉及細根，節間長1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm。體輕，質韌，折斷面纖維性，黃白色，多具放射狀裂隙，有時中心可見一小孔。氣微，味微甜。\n【性味】\t甘、寒。\n【功效】\t涼血，止血，清熱，利尿。治熱病煩渴，吐血，衄血，肺熱喘急，胃熱噦逆，淋病，小便不利，水腫，黃疸。"}]},{"ID":"20240205171750-ayr9iov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171750-ayr9iov","updated":"20240205171750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205171750-iov9wap.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162533-6p65lor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162533-6p65lor","updated":"20240205162533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白茅根"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白茅根-20240205162533-znevrwh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240625081223-2zyw1c1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625081223-2zyw1c1","updated":"20240625081230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 476px;","style":"width: 466px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240625081227-ggaaxh6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 466px;\" parent-style=\"width: 476px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814194143-fw96noa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814194143-fw96noa","updated":"20240814194159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240221192624-7rpmfnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221192624-7rpmfnf","updated":"20240814194247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茅根"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茅根-20240814194143-1sthi5n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 358px;\" parent-style=\"width: 368px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 369px;","style":"width: 359px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茅根2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茅根2-20240624175639-qff2xmw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 359px;\" parent-style=\"width: 369px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 399px